  "reason": "The existing evidence shows config_008 (validation accuracy 0.639) is the best so far, using pca_n2000 RNA, resnet50 image, avgpool, and weighted fusion. This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder while keeping other parameters the same. It clarifies whether the image encoder choice significantly impacts performance, a critical design decision with high uncertainty. This balances exploitation (building on config_008's success) and exploration (testing a key component variation)."
